toshiba-estudio2323am (0.1.4) unstable; urgency=low

  * 修根因：PPD 的可打印区（ImageableArea）比整页小 18pt，导致 CUPS 把光栅缩小
    一圈（A4 实测 4661x6716 而非 4961x7016），报文里 @PJL SET PAPER 只能落成
    CUSTOM。真机上 CUSTOM 会触发两个可观测故障：一律从手送（旁路）出纸、
    双面被忽略。现改为整页可打印区，与 Windows 驱动送出的全幅光栅一致。
  * PAPER 取值改为三级判定：CUPS media 关键字 → raster 头的 cupsPageSize（点）
    → 像素尺寸兜底。此前只按像素查表，一旦光栅尺寸被上游改动就必然退化成 CUSTOM。
  * 补充 A6/B5/LEGAL/EXECUTIVE 等尺寸，修正 STATEMENT 的像素值（原 3300x4200 错）。

 -- kesat666 <keast606@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:55:00 +0800

toshiba-estudio2323am (0.1.3) unstable; urgency=low

  * 托盘真值固化：主纸盒 = MEDIASOURCE=TRAY1（默认）。0.1.2 的默认 AUTO 在本机
    会被打印机解析成旁路托盘，表现为"出纸走旁路"。取值源自驱动 eSSh6CFG.xml 的
    托盘表（Tray1/Tray2/ManualFeed/Auto），并用 file:// 真实管线捕获 Windows
    驱动的输出 MEDIASOURCE=TRAY1 佐证。
  * TSBMediaSource 选项从 CASSETTE(guess) 改为 TRAY1/TRAY2/MANUALFEED/AUTO，
    默认 TRAY1。
  * 双面：经驱动 DLL(eSSh6OCM.dll) 提取 PJL 模板确认，Windows 驱动发出的就是
    @PJL SET DUPLEX=ON + BINDING=LONGEDGE|SHORTEDGE，与本驱动完全一致。故长/短
    边 token 不动；若上机仍固定短边，再评估背面图像旋转方案。

 -- kesat666 <keast606@gmail.com>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:30:00 +0800

toshiba-estudio2323am (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=low

  * Make MEDIASOURCE / MEDIATYPE / BINDING runtime-selectable via PPD options
    (TSBMediaSource / TSBMT / TSBBinding) so the exact PJL tokens can be
    tried on real hardware with `lp -o` instead of rebuilding each time.
  * Wire the encoder to actually emit MEDIASOURCE/MEDIATYPE from job options
    (previously hardcoded to AUTO/PAPER, ignoring the TSB_SLOT/TSB_MEDIATYPE
    environment knobs entirely).
  * Defaults unchanged (AUTO / PAPER / derived from Duplex) so existing installs
    keep behaving as before until the correct tokens are confirmed by capture.
  * Background: first on-hardware print succeeded (JBIG BIE accepted), but the
    device fed from the bypass tray on MEDIASOURCE=AUTO and ignored BINDING.
    Both tokens need a real Windows capture to pin down (see docs/protocol-re.md
    section 8).

